{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>Concerning Arabia.</b> Like 'the kings of Arabia' (Jeremiah 25:24), the families of Kedar, and likewise 'in the forest of Arabia' [ביער בערב]." "<b>Dedanites.</b> Like 'Sheba and Dedan' (Genesis 10:6). The reason is that their land is hot and dry, and it lacks water."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:31.262248537Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}